{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一隻柴犬於今日（17日）清晨時分突然誤闖天水圍站車站大堂，引起不少途人關注。幸狗隻性格極為溫馴乖巧，全程不吠不鬧，最終在港鐵職員及愛護動物協會人員協助下安全離去。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-18-16h19m12s087.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026k6zPC60TgV1789720243.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-18-16h19m12s087.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據網民於早上 7 時半直擊所示，該隻柴犬闖入車站大堂後，並無表現驚慌，只是安靜地趴在地下休息，過程中沒有發出大吠大叫。當港鐵職員上前查看時，柴犬亦展現出高度配合，親和力十足地任由職員摸頭安撫。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-18 下午4.18.24.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026LMSXRW3AUk1789720254.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-18 下午4.18.24.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">港鐵回應傳媒時證實，今早約 7 時許，天水圍站職員發現有狗隻於車站大堂徘徊，職員隨即引導牠前往安全位置並予以看顧。其後，愛護動物協會人員應召到場協助，將狗隻安全帶走。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T09:13:52.908036+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}